{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1487067-c20-m20-w20-amnesia-flaw-does-it-grant-extra-freebies","id":1487067,"title":"[C20 / M20 / W20] Amnesia Flaw, does it grant extra freebies?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-19T16:01:35-07:00","id":1487067,"title":"[C20 / M20 / W20] Amnesia Flaw, does it grant extra freebies?","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> The Amnesia flaw in C20, W20 and M20 states something similar to:<br /> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:Goudy\">You may take up to five more points in Flaws that remain unknown to you. Your Storyteller picks them for you and brings them into play (to your surprise) during the course of your chronicle.</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <br /> My question is <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>Do the extra 5 flaw dots grant you 5 extra freebies above the 7 Flaw limit (for C20, W20) or 13 dot limit (M20)?</b><br /> <br /> The opinions differ on <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1486881-m20-amnesia-flaw\">M20</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1436296-w20-flaws-limits-and-recommendations?p=1486925#post1486925\">W20</a>.<br /> <br /> What makes more sense?</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 07-19-2022, 09:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T00:51:32-07:00","id":1487121,"title":"","content":"I assume the hard limit still applies and you get all the freebies for the secret Flaws at chargen. <br /> <br /> Amnesia just means you don't have to pick the last five points of Flaws yourself; the ST will do it for you and reveal them further down the line.<br /> <br /> So, if Amnesia is a 2-pt Flaw and your limit is seven points of Flaws, then you can't take any more points of Flaws besides Amnesia. If the limit is 13 points, then you can take six more points in Flaws.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 07-24-2022, 05:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T17:52:41-07:00","id":1487288,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5291_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5291\" data-vbnamecard=\"5291\">adambeyoncelowe</a> Thanks for the answer.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5